(abusing notation and use $\widetilde\mathbb H(\mathcal X):\tilde Z_\bullet\to H^0(\mathsf{Ch}_{R[[H]]})$ to denote the composition of $\widetilde\mathbb H(\mathcal X)$ with the forgetful functor $\mathsf{N}_{\mathsf{dg}}\to H^0$).  The hypotheses of Lemma \ref{descentofdiagram} are satisfied by Propositions \ref{trivialKanfibration} and \ref{degenerateID}, and hence we get a canonical descent:
