We give $C_\bullet(E;\mathcal A)^+\oplus C_{\bullet-1}^{S^1}(E;\mathcal A)^+$ the structure of an $\mathsf{F}$-module with product/face maps of the shape \eqref{CSSproductfacesplitfirst}--\eqref{CSSproductfacesplitlast} just as in Definition \ref{CEcomplexaugmented}.  Then both maps \eqref{CESSpushforward} are maps of $\mathsf{F}$-modules.  There is also a pushforward map:
